Scientific data and models — NOT bundled
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No external scientific dataset or atmosphere model is bundled with this
distribution. Where such resources are used at runtime they are retrieved
under the terms recorded in planning/registry/resources.yaml, and the
following are excluded from the production path by internal policy:

  NRLMSIS 2.0/2.1   NRL academic non-commercial terms; US Patent 10,641,925
                    recorded separately (a patent is not a licence status)
  DTM2020           CNES academic non-commercial terms
  SET HASDM         research-only terms
  WDC Kyoto indices commercial use not permitted by the publisher
  ADBSat            GPL-3.0 (commercial use permitted under copyleft
                    obligations) plus a proprietary MATLAB dependency;
                    excluded by strict-permissive policy, not by prohibition
  Nyx               AGPL-3.0 (commercial use permitted under network-copyleft
                    obligations); excluded by strict-permissive policy

Physical constants are taken from NIST/CODATA (US Government work, freely
usable with citation): https://physics.nist.gov/cuu/Constants/
